    "title": "River View, Coshocton plan blood drive rivalry - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Josie Sellers Beacon Editor ,\n21 hours ago On Oct. 21 River View and Coshocton will take each other on in a blood drive battle scheduled at each high school. “We have lacked people to donate the past few drives, so we have partnered with Coshocton High School to hopefully get more people,” said Avie Wright, a senior at River View. “Who doesn't want to beat their rival school?” Read full article",
